@mattbruman there isn't an easy way to incorporate this into your existing installation (by design so things don't get permanently screwed up).  I recommend installing the development version on your local machine using Docker and VS code.

Install guide: https://developers.home-assistant.io/docs/development_environment/

Once you have it cloned from GitHub and installed, select the branch from that PR above.  Then setup the SharkIQ integration as you would normally through the UI.
